Bind Npc 31562 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 31561 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 663 "How to hunt"
    Journal for karus "You must talk to [Hunter] Zarg."
    Journal for elmorad "You must talk to [Hunter] Halon."

Requires player level >= 61

Rewards none

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Master, Jarg the [Hunter] is at Donna camp. You, too, are a skilled hunter. How about a match with him?"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Master, Halon the [Hunter] is at Raon camp. You, too, are a skilled hunter. How about a match with him?"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "What the... Who are you?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Say "What? You want to hunt with me? Hahahaha! You just make me laugh."
            Topic "Tell me more..." do
                Say "So you think you've got enough skills? Have you even had a proper hunting before?"
                Topic "Tell me more..." do
                    Show quest "You must hunter Karus Local Donna camp  Cut the conversation with him."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "What the... Who are you?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Say "What? You want to hunt with me? Hahahaha! You just make me laugh."
            Topic "Tell me more..." do
                Say "So you think you've got enough skills? Have you even had a proper hunting before?"
                Topic "Tell me more..." do
                    Show quest "Raon Camp El Morad region of the hunter must dialogue with the halon."

On claimable
    Show quest "Well, it doesn't matter. Anyway, you'll have to learn how to hunt first. Will you learn it from me? If you're willing to learn it, bring ten [Blood of Wolves], [Horn Crossbow (+3)] and five thousand [Arrows]. By the way, you can make [Horn Crossbow (+3)] by refining [Horn Crossbow (+1)], which you can buy at the store on an anvil."
